  "details": "Bug Report: Online Status Reverting from Online (Green) to Away/Busy (Red) Unexpectedly\n\nDescription:\n\nI am experiencing an issue where my online status is automatically reverting from “Online” (green) to “Away/Busy” (red) without any user interaction.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Set status manually to “Online” (green)\n\n3. Continue using the application normally\n\n4. Observe that the status changes back to “Away/Busy” (red) without input\n\nExpected Result:\n\nThe selected status (“Online”) should remain active until manually changed by the user.\n\nActual Result:\n\nThe status automatically reverts to “Away/Busy” (red) after a short period or immediately without user input.\n\nFrequency:\n\nConsistent / occurs repeatedly during normal use.\n\nAdditional Information:\n\n* Internet connection is stable\n\n* Issue occurs without user inactivity in some cases\n\n* Restarting the application does not permanently resolve the issue\n\n* No manual override is applied by the user after setting status to online",
